  "metadata": {
    "title": "IS Seismic Data",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10370696",
    "publication_date": "2023-12-13",
    "description": "<p>IS Seismic data used to detect Hamas's pre-attack motions on Oct. 7. Results published in the following paper:</p>\n<p>Asaf Inbal; Forensic Seismic Evidence for Precursory Mobilization in Gaza Leading to the October 7 Hamas Attack. The Seismic Record 2024;; 4 (4): 288&ndash;298.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1785/0320240018\">doi</a></p>\n<p>Dataset contents:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compressed tar.gz files contain data from the IS seismic network in mini-seed format</li>\n<li>resp.pyc: Python obspy inventory with instrument response in pickle format</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "access_right": "open",
    "creators": [
